{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/2fa40c881aed81630c611ed2c3404328.avif?t=1773335990\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras_big/2fa40c881aed81630c611ed2c3404328.avif?t=1773335990 width=800 height=138 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore The Vast White at your own pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a solitary snowboarding journey down a vast, untamed mountain where every run is unique. <i>The Vast White</i> blends exploration, storytelling, and the thrill of the descent into a seamless open-world adventure. With only your board and your instincts, carve through pristine alpine wilderness, uncover hidden trails, and unravel the secrets buried beneath the snow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f <strong>An Open Mountain to Conquer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride at your own pace through sprawling peaks, frozen forests, and secluded valleys\u2014every path you choose reveals new wonders and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/a83f36647c5fb8e2a30198fac74f2918.poster.avif?t=1773335990\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/a83f36647c5fb8e2a30198fac74f2918.webm?t=1773335990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/a83f36647c5fb8e2a30198fac74f2918.mp4?t=1773335990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \u2744\ufe0f <strong>Uncover the Mountain\u2019s Mysteries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of the mountain to find hidden routes, and stunning landscapes that reveal the mountain's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f <strong>Encounters on the Snow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross paths with wanderers, hermits, and fellow adventurers\u2014each with their own tales, quests, and clues to hidden routes. Will you help them, or focus on the ride ahead?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to explore <i>The Vast White</i>? Grab your board and take on the mountain like never before.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3301000?t=1773335990","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3301000?t=1773335990","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/2210ad737ba5d5fd57df45c218d946adbe310ae2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773335990","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/2210ad737ba5d5fd57df45c218d946adbe310ae2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773335990","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3650220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/2fa40c881aed81630c611ed2c3404328.avif?t=1773335990\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras_big/2fa40c881aed81630c611ed2c3404328.avif?t=1773335990 width=800 height=138 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore The Vast White at your own pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a solitary snowboarding journey down a vast, untamed mountain where eve